sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Customer
    participant P as Provider
    participant E as MilestoneEscrow
    participant A as Arbitrator
    C->>E: createDeal(provider, arbitrator, deadline, termsHash) + test funds
    P->>E: submitDelivery(id)
    C->>E: accept(id)
    Note over E: Resolved; provider credit allocated
    P->>E: withdraw()
    E-->>P: Local test payment
    Note over C,A: Alternative path while Funded or Submitted
    C->>E: openDispute(id) or requestResolution(id) after expiry
    A->>E: resolve(id, customerAmount)
    Note over E: Customer and provider credits allocated
